        width=72
        height=72
        loading="lazy"
      />
    <h2 class="zguide-title">Glossary</h2>
    <div class="zguide-def">
      <div class="zguide-def-term">Aether Points</div>
      <p class="zguide-def-desc">
        Used for everything that needs leveling: characters, remembrances, talents, runes.
      </p>
    </div>
    <div class="zguide-def">
      <div class="zguide-def-term">Annihilation Coin</div>
      <p class="zguide-def-desc">
        Currency earned in the Annihilation Battle. Can be used in the "Starbreaker" shop for
        various items including low ranked remembrances.
      </p>
    </div>
    <div class="zguide-def">
      <div class="zguide-def-term">Arena Coins</div>
      <p class="zguide-def-desc">
        Currency earned in the arena. Can be used in the "Arena Shop" for various items such as
        levelling items, training props, luminite, profile card backgrounds.
      </p>
    </div>
    <div class="zguide-def">
      <div class="zguide-def-term">Bonding Attempts</div>
      <p class="zguide-def-desc">
        Increase the bonding item uses per day. If you P2W, it can go above the free maximum of
        30 bonding attempts. This stops the natural regeneration until it falls below the 30
        attempts again. See "Training Props" for more.
      </p>
    </div>
    <div class="zguide-def">
      <div class="zguide-def-term">Combat EXP</div>
      <p class="zguide-def-desc">
        Used to level up the account level (as of Nov. 2026, max is level 70).
      </p>
    </div>
    <div class="zguide-def">
      <div class="zguide-def-term">Dust</div>
      <p class="zguide-def-desc">Used for crafting various items including Mirage Cubes and Energy Cubes.</p>
    </div>
    <div class="zguide-def">
      <div class="zguide-def-term">Energy</div>
      <p class="zguide-def-desc">
        Resource for character ultimates during battles. Each character has a base "Energy
        Recovery" of 0.25 per second. With all 4 alive and no buffs or debuffs: 1 energy per
        second. Certain characters can buff or debuff this (e.g. Sharin, Belz, Tamamo, Bedivere).
      </p>
    </div>
    <div class="zguide-def">
      <div class="zguide-def-term">Energy Cubes</div>
      <p class="zguide-def-desc">Used for normal characters and remembrances in Gacha.</p>
    </div>
    <div class="zguide-def">
      <div class="zguide-def-term">Engraver Card</div>
      <p class="zguide-def-desc">Used in rune crafting for setting a secondary stat.</p>
    </div>
    <div class="zguide-def">
      <div class="zguide-def-term">Event Currency</div>
      <p class="zguide-def-desc">
        Event specific currency that can be used in the Event Exchange Shop.
      </p>
    </div>
    <div class="zguide-def">
      <div class="zguide-def-term">Gold Medals</div>
      <p class="zguide-def-desc">Buy items in the Gold Medal Shop.</p>
    </div>
    <div class="zguide-def">
      <div class="zguide-def-term">Guild Coins / Guild Conquest Tokens</div>
      <p class="zguide-def-desc">Buy items in the Guild Shop.</p>
    </div>
    <div class="zguide-def">
      <div class="zguide-def-term">Mirage Cubes</div>
      <p class="zguide-def-desc">Used for rare and strong characters and remembrances in Gacha.</p>
    </div>
    <div class="zguide-def">
      <div class="zguide-def-term">Laser Engraver</div>
      <p class="zguide-def-desc">Used in rune crafting for setting the main stat.</p>
    </div>
    <div class="zguide-def">
      <div class="zguide-def-term">Luminite Crystal</div>
      <p class="zguide-def-desc">
        Mainly used for Mirage Cube exchange. Get new characters and remembrances in the Gacha
        area.
      </p>
    </div>
    <div class="zguide-def">
      <div class="zguide-def-term">Stamina</div>
      <p class="zguide-def-desc">
        Resource for raids. Natural regeneration is 1 stamina every 5 minutes (25 hours from 0 to
        300). Various items can be used to refill stamina such as Luminite (not worth it!),
        Stamina Restorer (the green tanks, 60 stamina each, only if you happen to have some),
        special event rewards such as Halloween pumpkin candy (300 stamina each).
      </p>
    </div>
    <div class="zguide-def">
      <div class="zguide-def-term">The Original Aether</div>
      <p class="zguide-def-desc">Critical rare item that is needed for levelling skills.</p>
    </div>
    <div class="zguide-def">
      <div class="zguide-def-term">Training Props</div>
      <p class="zguide-def-desc">
        Character bonding items. You can use 30 of them daily for free. Natural regeneration: 1
        attempt per 30 minutes. If you cannot wait, you will need additional "bonding attempts"
        items.
      </p>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="zguide-section" id="profile">
