    <h2 class="zguide-title">Player Profile</h2>
    <p>
      From the start page, click on the account profile icon
      <img
        class="zguide-inline-icon"
        src="https://k2b1c5ab57ed98e51.gachawiki.info/zone-nova/beginner-guide/icon-account.png"
