        width={36}
        height={36}
        loading="lazy"
      />
      (the girl avatar) at the top left corner. Here, you can:
    </p>
    <ul>
      <li>Change your name (once every 72 hours).</li>
      <li>Change your icon (selection depends on the unlocked girls).</li>
      <li>
        Note that the chibi icons are ordered depending on their banner releases. This order
        allows you to predict their reruns.
      </li>
      <li>Change your frame (many of them are won by participating in PvP).</li>
      <li>Edit profile (meaning: leave a message in your profile).</li>
      <li>Change profile background (can be bought in shops. Some of them are won in the PvP tournament).</li>
      <li>Showcase your favorite characters.</li>
      <li>
        Add support characters. A friend can use one of these during their battles (instead of
        their own character; story mode battles only?).
      </li>
    </ul>
