      <img src="https://k2b1c5ab57ed98e51.gachawiki.info/zone-nova/avatars/4025-cute.png" alt="Tamamo-no-Mae chibi avatar" width={56} height={56} loading="lazy" />
      <img src="https://k2b1c5ab57ed98e51.gachawiki.info/zone-nova/avatars/4061-cute.png" alt="Suzuka Gozen chibi avatar" width={56} height={56} loading="lazy" />
    </div>
    <p class="zguide-note">Examples of the chibi style profile avatars.</p>
